# Torre de los Recuerdos, 4F (the top, ghost tower 7F: the old man, C4b, contract 41), 12 x 10, interior. Two Vertice grunts hold the old man of Pueblo Bruma (`anciano`, `a character`): beat them (flags 810 / 811) and he thanks you, takes you home
# (warp to casa_anciano spawn `home`, flag 808) and there gives you the FLAUTA (`flauta`, flag 809; chapter 5 uses it). The wild ghosts of 3F walk here too (same table).
@map torre_4
@size 12 10
@interior yes
@fog yes
@ghosts yes
@area torre_recuerdos
@bg 3
@fill oplank_00
@spawn down 2 3 S
@flag torre_grunt_a 810
@flag torre_grunt_b 811
@flag anciano_rescued 808
@encounters grass rate=11
  wispsheet 21 25 55
  hatchkip 21 24 30
  shroudle 24 26 15
@end
@legend
  .  tile=oplank_00
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  tile=oplank_11
  f  tile=oplank_01 object=escalator
  g  tile=oplank_01
  h  tile=oplank_10
  i  tile=oplank_00 door=escalator
  j  tile=oplank_01 object=candle
  k  tile=oplank_11 object=candle
  l  tile=none object=wall_win_i
  m  tile=oplank_d_00
  n  tile=oplank_d_10
  o  tile=oplank_10 npc=anciano id=anciano face=SW script=anciano hide_flag=808
  p  tile=oplank_11 object=stele_a
  q  tile=oplank_d_01
  r  tile=oplank_11 npc=vertice id=t1 face=E trainer=vertice_t1 range=3 text=tr.vertice_t1.pre after=tr.vertice_t1.after beaten_flag=torre_grunt_a
  s  tile=oplank_01 item=prime_salve
  t  tile=oplank_10 npc=vertice id=t2 face=N trainer=vertice_t2 range=3 text=tr.vertice_t2.pre after=tr.vertice_t2.after beaten_flag=torre_grunt_b
  u  tile=oplank_d_11
  v  tile=oplank_10 object=stele_b
  w  tile=oplank_00 object=candle
  x  tile=oplank_00 object=stele_a
@grid
  abbbcbbbcbbb
  defegegegege
  dhih.h.h.h.h
  degejegkgeje
  lh.hmn.h.o.h
  dpgeqegrgese
  dh.h.h.h.t.h
  deguqegegege
  lvwh.vmhmnxh
  degegegeqege
@warp i -> torre_3 spawn=up
# The old man: while a grunt stands he asks for help; once both are beaten he thanks you, takes you to his house (the warp) and there gives the Flauta (casa_anciano).
@script anciano npc
    npc_face_hero anciano
    jnf torre_grunt_a help
    jnf torre_grunt_b help
    say torre.anciano.thanks
    say torre.anciano.thanks2
    say torre.anciano.home
    setf anciano_rescued
    sfx door
    warp casa_anciano spawn=home
    end
  help:
    say torre.anciano.help
@end
